1
00:00:00,057 --> 00:00:01,387
(Penny:)You were okay with that?

2
00:00:01,392 --> 00:00:02,392
No. I got upset!

3
00:00:02,393 --> 00:00:05,563
(Leonard:)And Sheldon made me
a beverage, too.

4
00:00:05,563 --> 00:00:07,593
(Penny:)Okay, he just
showed up at my door.

5
00:00:07,598 --> 00:00:08,898
(Penny:)Don't you think
that's a little weird?

6
00:00:08,899 --> 00:00:11,669
(Leonard:)A little, but... he's
basically harmless.

7
00:00:11,669 --> 00:00:13,599
(Leonard:)He's actually kind
of a nice guy.
Okay.

8
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:15,274
(Penny:)Whatever, look,
my company does not allow me

9
00:00:15,272 --> 00:00:16,842
(Penny:)to socialize with doctors
outside of work.

10
00:00:16,841 --> 00:00:17,911
(Penny:)You got to get rid of him.

11
00:00:17,908 --> 00:00:20,508
(Leonard:)Why am I the one that
has to get rid of him?

12
00:00:20,511 --> 00:00:22,711
I can't do it!
He's my best client!

13
00:00:22,713 --> 00:00:24,843
(Leonard:)All right, I'll
get rid of him.

14
00:00:24,849 --> 00:00:26,749
(Leonard:)But you owe me one.

15
00:00:26,751 --> 00:00:29,021
(Raj:)Hey, we're going to Oliver's
house to see his collection.

16
00:00:29,019 --> 00:00:30,019
(Raj:)You want to go with us?

17
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,920
(Leonard:)Yeah, sure.

18
00:00:32,923 --> 00:00:34,753
(Leonard:)You owe me.

19
00:00:41,432 --> 00:00:43,502
(buzzing, beeping and whirring)

20
00:00:45,803 --> 00:00:48,203
Oh, my God!

21
00:00:49,874 --> 00:00:51,974
(Sheldon:)Leonard, I was wrong.

22
00:00:51,976 --> 00:00:54,476
(Sheldon:)Heaven does exist.

23
00:00:54,478 --> 00:00:56,908
(Sheldon:)And it's in the basement
of a urologist's house

24
00:00:56,914 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon:)in Sherman Oaks.

